OL,3,ABoy, 14, denies murdering teenage girl
OL,4,Awhose body was found in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has denied murdering
OL,7,Fa teenage girl whose body was found in
OL,8,Fwoodland.
OL,10,FLilly Jones, also 14, was discovered in
OL,11,FDuffryn Park in Blaina, Blaenau Gwent,
OL,12,Fon 22 June, two days after her family
OL,13,Freported her missing.
OL,15,FShe died of multiple stab wounds to the
OL,16,Fneck and body.
OL,18,FAt Newport Crown Court on Tuesday, the
OL,19,Fdefendant from Blaenau Gwent, who
OL,20,Fcannot be named for legal reasons,
OL,21,Fpleaded not guilty to her murder.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
